// vendor_spend.proto — WHAT VENDOR CALLS SPENT: the vendor's own usage of
// each call, tagged by what the call was, for the daemon's always-on spend
// metrics (skills/agent-repl-metrics/CATALOG.md, `agentrepl_vendor_*`).
//
// IN conversation.v1 BECAUSE EVERY PRODUCER SHARES IT: the shim counts its
// session's calls into its measurements frame (shim.v1.ShimMeasurements),
// and Emacs reports its own headless calls to the daemon
// (agentrepl.v1.ReportVendorSpend). conversation.v1 is the one package both
// import, and it is where PromptOrigin's causes are declared.
//
// THE FIGURES ARE THE VENDOR'S. A producer counts the counters of each
// call's `usage` as the vendor stated them, once per call (one per message
// id), and derives only the tags below from them. No price is stored: a
// price-weighted figure is the metrics skill's to derive, from the one table
